## 🐶 DATADOG

- Third-party **SaaS-based monitoring & observability platform** (works across cloud, on-prem, hybrid).
- Provides Infrastructure Monitoring, APM (Application Performance Monitoring), Log Management, and Real User Monitoring (RUM) in one platform.
- Uses lightweight **Datadog Agent** installed on hosts/containers to collect metrics/logs/traces.
- **Dashboards** – highly customizable, real-time visualizations.
- **Monitors** – set alerts on metrics/logs/traces, notify via Slack, email, PagerDuty.
- Supports **distributed tracing** – track a request across multiple microservices (helps in root cause analysis).
- Integrates with 600+ technologies (AWS, Docker, Kubernetes, Jenkins, etc.).
- **Tags** – key-value pairs used to filter/group/organize resources across the platform.
- Log Management – centralize, search, and analyze logs at scale with indexing/filtering.
- Advantage over CloudWatch: works across multi-cloud, richer UI, better correlation between metrics/logs/traces, easier to use for teams managing hybrid/multi-cloud environments.

